# Student Management System

A simple Java console-based Student Management System designed to manage student records.

## Project Description

This project is a beginner-friendly Java application that demonstrates object-oriented programming concepts and basic student record management.

## Features

* Add a new student
* View all students
* Search for a student by ID
* Delete a student
* Interactive console menu

## Technologies Used

* Java
* Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)
* ArrayList
* Scanner
* GitHub

## Student Information

The system stores:

* Student ID
* Student Name
* Email
* Course

## Example

```text
===== Student Management System =====
1. Add Student
2. View Students
3. Search Student
4. Delete Student
5. Exit

Enter your choice: 1

Enter Student ID: 101
Enter Name: Arun
Enter Email: arun@gmail.com
Enter Course: Java

Student added successfully!
```

## How to Run

1. Download `Main.java`.
2. Open it in a Java IDE such as IntelliJ IDEA.
3. Make sure Java JDK is installed.
4. Run the `Main` class.
5. Follow the instructions displayed in the console.

## Learning Objectives

This project was created to practice:

* Java classes and objects
* Constructors
* Encapsulation
* Collections
* Loops
* Conditional statements
* User input
* Basic GitHub project management

## Future Improvements

Planned improvements include:

* Separate `Student.java` class
* Update student information
* MySQL database integration
* Spring Boot REST API
* Web-based user interface
* Student login and authentication
